{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X-Magnifier</strong> is an advanced version of the standard Windows magnification tool, specifically designed to zoom specific areas of game screens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X-Magnifier features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>User-friendly setup</strong> of the magnification area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick zoom toggling</strong> functionality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magnifier <strong>masks</strong> to highlight and enhance the appearance of zoom areas (premium feature)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic<strong> mouse sensitivity </strong>adjust while zooming</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important</strong>: the program operates without using hooks or modifying game files. No modifications - no problems.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634180?t=1757012457","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634180?t=1757012457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634180/6787f16ea4a2c118e958e768e1c6d3044d93caba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757012457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634180/6787f16ea4a2c118e958e768e1c6d3044d93caba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757012457","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X-Magnifier</strong> is an advanced version of the standard Windows magnification tool, specifically designed to zoom specific areas of game screens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X-Magnifier features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>User-friendly setup</strong> of the magnification area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick zoom toggling</strong> functionality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magnifier <strong>